### 5.3 Flamethrower Reload or Fuel Replacement

If the existing Flamethrower uses limited fuel, implement an appropriate refill animation.

Possible animation details:
- Release fuel container.
- Remove or detach the fuel canister.
- Insert the replacement canister.
- Reconnect the fuel system.
- Perform a final readiness action.

