- Firing is disabled during reload.
- Ammo updates at the appropriate animation moment.
- Reload sound effects synchronize with each action.
- Reload cannot be duplicated.
- Repeated input must not interrupt the animation incorrectly.
- Reload completion restores normal firing.

Use animation events or equivalent synchronization.

Avoid simply changing the ammunition counter immediately when reload begins.

